{"type":"message","id":"2a3acdac","parentId":"5bc940fc","timestamp":"2026-02-18T17:21:37.860Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-02-18 22:51 GMT+5:30] Debug the WhatsApp flicker issue: Investigate why the WhatsApp connection is experiencing flickering (disconnects/reconnects). Check logs, configuration, and plugin behavior. Identify the root cause and provide a fix. Report findings and recommended solution."}],"timestamp":1771435297857}}
{"type":"message","id":"1c700ca0","parentId":"2a3acdac","timestamp":"2026-02-18T17:21:47.447Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to debug a WhatsApp flicker issue - specifically investigating why the WhatsApp connection is experiencing disconnects/reconnects. I need to:\n\n1. Check logs\n2. Check configuration\n3. Check plugin behavior\n4. Identify the root cause\n5. Provide a fix\n6. Report findings and recommended solution\n\nLet me start by understanding the project structure and then investigating the WhatsApp-related code. From the AGENTS.md file, I can see that WhatsApp is one of the messaging channels, and the web provider is in `src/provider-web.ts`. There's also `extensions/*` for channel plugins.\n\nFirst, I need to:\n- Find WhatsApp-specific code\n- Look for configuration files\n- Check logs if available\n- Understand how WhatsApp connection is maintained\n\nLet's start by exploring the repository structure to find WhatsApp-related code.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"I'll help you debug the WhatsApp flicker issue. Let me start by investigating the WhatsApp connection implementation, configuration, and logs."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_a7f09f528c114dd1ab9fee6a","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"D:\\workspace\\appDev\\openclaw"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":12673,"output":458,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":13131,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771435297860}}
